{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟AI驅動的超解像度技術Auto SR現已正式登陸ROG Xbox Ally掌機，為該設備提供AI超解像度功能。根據微軟DirectX開發者博客的公告，Auto SR已結束預覽階段，正式支持ROG Xbox Ally X與Ally X20兩款機型，並擴展至部分搭載AMD鋭龍處理器的Windows Copilot+ PC。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586062.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:44:30.450014+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:29:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:37:52.497420+00:00","content_hash":"4f85c98fa1d803d89172d12e61630494a85e26b52e0a4ade40737f67a581d2b1","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}